====George Cooper Sr.====
[[File:Lance Barber at Fan Expo Denver 2026.jpg|thumb|upright|Lance Barber]]
George Cooper Sr. (portrayed by [[Lance Barber]]; main: ''Young Sheldon''; guest: ''The Big Bang Theory'' season 12 and ''Georgie & Mandy's First Marriage'' seasons 1,2) was the husband of Mary Cooper and father of Georgie, Sheldon, and Missy. He was the high school football coach for Medford High. In ''The Big Bang Theory'', it is established that he died when Sheldon and Missy were fourteen years old due to an off-screen [[Myocardial infarction|heart attack]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rice |first=Lynette |date=May 10, 2024 |title=''Young Sheldon'': How Producers Addressed The Inevitable Tragedy That Rocks The Cooper Family |url=https://deadline.com/2024/05/young-sheldon-george-cooper-death-final-season-1235910517/ |access-date=May 10, 2024 |website=Deadline |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Alexander |first=Bryan |title=''Young Sheldon'' tragedy: George Cooper's death is flawed father's ''Big Bang'' redemption |url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/09/young-sheldon-george-cooper-death/73593800007/ |access-date=May 10, 2024 |website=USA TODAY |language=en-US}}</ref>

Barber previously portrayed Jimmy Speckerman in one episode of ''The Big Bang Theory'' (guest: season 5).

