=== ''The Big Bang Theory'' ===
==== Alex Jensen ====
[[File:Margo Harshman.jpg|thumb|upright|[[Margo Harshman]]]]
Alex Jensen ([[Margo Harshman]]) is a Caltech graduate student who [[The Big Bang Theory season 6|appears in season six]]. Sheldon hires her to review his kindergarten and elementary-school notebooks for any possible Nobel Prize–winning research and attend to the tasks that Sheldon perceives as a waste of his own valuable time, such as buying Amy a Valentine's Day gift.

Alex attempts to initiate a relationship with Leonard despite his involvement with Penny, but he is oblivious to her romantic overtures.

